cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "discretus: A Discrete Mathematics library for Python"
abstract: >-
  discretus is a rigorous, production-grade library for discrete mathematics
  in pure Python. It covers set theory, mathematical logic, combinatorics,
  graph theory, number theory, recurrence relations, and abstract algebra
  behind a single coherent application programming interface.
